The loops in these banks were rendered with tools/make_bank.py.

From the example engine presets of enginesound (https://github.com/DasEtwas/enginesound,
commit e5fcca587397c0c8ba9c9d24874b951fed74d260):

  big_car_1    example1.esc    big_car_2    example2.esc    rally_car_1  example3.esc
  rally_car_2  example6.esc    synth_car_1  example5.esc    synth_car_2  src/default.esc

From the engine scripts of engine-sim (https://github.com/ange-yaghi/engine-sim,
commit 85f7c3b959a908ed5232ede4f1a4ac7eafe6b630), recorded with tools/esrec:

  truck        assets/engines/chevrolet/chev_truck_454.mr
  bmw_m52      assets/engines/bmw/M52B28.mr
  supra        assets/engines/atg-video-2/03_2jz.mr
  lfa          assets/engines/atg-video-2/10_lfa_v10.mr
  muscle_car   assets/engines/atg-video-2/11_merlin_v12.mr

